---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About" description="About Amrit.">
  <section class="pt-4">
    <h1 class="text-2xl font-medium tracking-tight">About</h1>
    <div class="prose mt-8">
      <p>
        I'm Amrit — I write C++ and Go, mostly for Linux systems software.
        Most of what I build lives somewhere around Wayland compositors,
        TUI tools, and the small daemons that hold a desktop together.
      </p>
      <p>
        My daily driver is NixOS running Niri, and a fair amount of what I
        write about here comes directly out of that setup: things I built
        because I wanted them, bugs I chased down at 2am, and whatever I'm
        learning at the moment.
      </p>
      <p>
        Outside of that, I compete on Codeforces and AtCoder, and I'm slowly
        working on a fantasy novel with a sword-based magic system, which is
        a very different kind of building.
      </p>
      <p>
        You can find most of what I ship on
        {' '}<a href="https://github.com/WynnCr" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">GitHub</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
